`Entry → LedgerEntry` · `EntryType → EntryKind` · `ledger.all() → LedgerRepository.getAll()` · `uid() → createEntryId()` · `formatMonth() → monthKey() + formatMonthKey()` · `byCategory → categoryBreakdown` · `byMonth → monthlyBreakdown` · `analyze() → requestAnalysis() / GeminiClient.analyze()`

